 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000For NEGATIVES and QUESTIONS, we use did / didn't with the base verb (no -ed). Question: Did you enjoy the meal? Short answer: Yes, I did. / No, I didn't. Negative: The guest didn't order dessert. Time words: yesterday, last night, an hour ago, this morning.":{f:"528d7f26223fd388",d:21.600,v:0.771,a:0.200,b:20.800,wd:[0.24, 0.6, 1.28, 1.67, 2.44, 2.8, 3.12, 3.52, 3.54, 4.13, 4.53, 4.84, 5.24, 5.72, 5.96, 6.43, 7.23, 7.54, 7.86, 8.34, 8.68, 9.16, 9.68, 10.24, 10.64, 10.8, 11.16, 11.35, 11.67, 11.83, 12.52, 13.26, 13.56, 14.05, 14.61, 15.08, 15.8, 16.2, 16.72, 17.6, 18.02, 18.58, 18.81, 19.12, 19.64, 20.12],e:"000000NqjcbpqS0hNjYHIZRL00VlQMK0KSNJIGDIE0000VcVSXSLEDXWG0NL0XebWLINE0USKMEUN0PK0WZTPLM0EUPMKH00000LUWUTUTTPLID00000000000000000000000000L-",w:"00-----JQEIjox-qETQ--RQ8s-ITS----WPK43------cNolqkm---jgR----IUdaU----riMF8LN-a94Vqog----IGFB3eq---5USIEQegbWN5o----00000---------------keOU----XOJ62Jy----fV-eKDIA6-MGOMPE6KXbVNGBg----00000000000000000------CGJPZdcUB---OEB89----WrkgcVS-------aTZLDgZbcUI5p----00000000000000000------KZcW---CTSQIC85E----eebwesVAC88-------00----------------+4WgjnPSUWQJB-------Zn7-ihY-----SXPBDEBEGMI7-R--aPIEBDv------0000000000000000-----SZX89BINOLG5--------cta---OOebbXWSK---8EabU---8SVWYQNg----ofFWbLDCKOQG-QQJD974g----j---EEDHMGnlX72M----00000000000000000",r:"--00000ibnjID40BnYb00abt90jYZ0000Wchxy000000PeDGBHF000ILa0000jXORX0000AJfmtge0RsxWBDL0000jlmqyNB000wXZjnbNLQVewD0000-----000000000000000HNdX0000Udivzi30000MW0Nhojrv0fldfcnvhUQWelqL0000-----------------000000plicSOPXq000dnqts0000VAHLPWZ0000000RYSgoLSQPXjwC0000-----------------000000hSPW000pYZbjptwn0000NNQ5N9Wrptt0000000--00000000000000001xWLIEcZXWbiq0000000SEu0JKT00000ZUcqonqnlfju0a00Rcjnqo6000000----------------00000ZSUtsqjedglw00000000P8R000ddNQQUWZh000tnRQX000tZWVTbeL0000DMmVQgophdbl0bbiosuxL0000I000nnokflEGUuzf0000-----------------"},
